{"municipality_code":"20409","pref":"長野県","city":"平谷村","headline":"街道の街の雰囲気が感じられる可能性があります。","display_comment_enriched":"平谷村には、平谷村など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場にまつわる場所が点在し、「波合関跡」、「治部坂遺跡」、「浪合神社」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板、平谷村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板を既存ピンと照らし合わせながら歩くと、見落としがちな地域の物語に出会いやすくなります。 「雲谷寺」や「諏訪神社」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":20,"rank":1163,"percentile":38.0,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":13,"rank":1500,"percentile":18.8,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":1,"rank":1791,"percentile":2.1,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":1,"rank":574,"percentile":56.3,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":1,"rank":1563,"percentile":14.5,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":[],"tourism_landmarks":["雲谷寺","諏訪神社","武田勝頼公の腰かけ石","道の駅信州平谷","信州平谷温泉ひまわりの湯","平谷高原赤坂スキー場"],"food_c